HTML RULES (follow exactly):
- Output raw HTML only — the very first character must be < and the very last must be >
- Use inline CSS only (no <style> tags) — required for Gmail compatibility
- Outer wrapper: <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 24px;">
- Header bar: dark navy background (#1a1a2e), white text, candidate name large, position below it
