- Sections for: Executive Summary, Score Breakdown, Strengths, Areas for Improvement, Key Highlights, Risk Factors, Next Steps, Final Verdict
- Use <table> for the score bars section for email client compatibility
- Section headings: bold, navy color (#1a1a2e), border-bottom 2px solid #e0e0e0, padding-bottom 6px
- Body text: #333333, font-size 14px, line-height 1.6
- Lists: use <ul><li> tags with proper spacing, NO bullet symbols
- Footer: small grey text — 'Confidential HR Evaluation | Generated automatically'
- Do NOT include any mention of n8n in the footer or anywhere

